We first prove that $\overline{v}_i$, $i=1,...,m$, span $V^1_\mu$. For every  $v$ in $V^1_\mu =  (\mathbf{A}_1/\mathbf{J}_1) \otimes_{\mathbf{A}_1} (V_{\mathbf{A}_1})_\mu$ we have 
