where $a_i = b_i + \mathbf{J}_1 \in \mathbf{A}_1/\mathbf{J}_1$, $\overline{v}_i = (1 \otimes_{\mathbf{A}_1} v_i)$. So the set $\{1 \otimes_{\mathbf{A}_1} v_i\}$ $\mathbb{C}$-spans $ V^1_\mu$. The linear independence follows from the fact that $\{v_i\}$, $i=1,...,m$, are $\mathbf{A}_1$-linearly independent. 

